{
  "id": "ISA.43",
  "number": "43",
  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Isaia 43",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "43",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 43"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "43",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Katiaget ne kitiachi Israel ak boisiennyi ne kiyoktoe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago mwaei anyun Jehovah ne kiyain ko u ni kole, Ee Jakobo, ak inendet ne kimimiin, ee Israel: kole, Ameiywei, amu kiatiachin; kiaguurin eng’ kaineng’ung’, i nenyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami koboten ye ibune beek che chang’; ak ye ibune ainosiek, ko maimaluuchin; ye ibune mat, ko mabeelin; ama imelin liblibenetab mat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu a Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’ung’, Inendet ne Tilil ne bo Israel, Yetindeng’ung’; kaagoite Misri koek ne kitiagenen, koboto Etiopia ak Seba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu koiegu eng’ ane ne achame mising’, ak ne kigonyiti, ak kiachamin; agoitoi anyun bik agobo inye, ak agoite bik agobo sobeng’ung’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameiywei; amu ami koboten: amutu iyoteng’ung’ eng’ kong’asis, ayumin inyo eng’ cherongo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amwachini murot ne bo katam, alenjini, Konu; ak amwachi murot ne bo tai, alenji, Ametuuch; omutu werikyuk kobun ole loo, ak omutu tibikyuk eng’ tabanwekab ng’ony; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "age tugul ne kimwaitoe kainennyu, inendet ne kiatau ayai agobo torornatennyu; kiamimii; ee, kiayai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omutu bik che koriotin che tinyei konyek, ak omutu bik che ming’otin che tinyei itik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ingoyumgei bororiosiek tugul, ak ingoyumgei bik: ng’o eng’ ichek ne imuchi komwa ng’olyondonito, ak koboruech tuguk che bo tai? Ingomut baorinikwak, si kobiit kiityi imanda: anan ingogas, ak komwa kole, Bo iman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O baorinikyuk, mwaei Jehovah, ak otwogindennyu ne kialewen; si kobiit onai ak oyana, ak oguiye ole a inendet; mami Kamuktaindet age ne kisib keyai eng’ ane, ama kobiitu age eng’ let. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ane, ee, anendet, a Jehovah; ama mi yetindet age kobatena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiamwaite, ak kiasoru, ak kiabarte, ama mi cheptalelit ne ter eng’ kwenung’wong’: o baorinikyuk anyun, mwaei Jehovah, ak a Kamuktaindet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee, a inendet koboch agoi, ama mi age ne imuchi koreb eng’ eunnyu: aboisiei, ak ng’o ne imuchi koger? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaei Jehovah, katiagindeng’wong’, Inendet ne Tilil ne bo Israel, ko u ni, kole: Kiayokte ng’olyot kwo Babulon agobo okwek, ak achooru ichek tugul ko u che mweoti, choto bo Kaldeik, eng’ melisiek che boiboitune. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Jehovah, neng’wong’ Ne Tilil, Yaindetab Israel, Laitoriandeng’wong’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaei Jehovah, ne yaei oret eng’ nyanjet, ak oret eng’ beek che kimen; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne moong’u karit ak mbartanyit koboto luget ak kimnatet; ruitos tugul ng’ony, ama ng’eetos kogeny; kagobetyo, kagimis ko u kitambit: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amat obwat tuguk che bo tai, amat ogererji met tuguk che bo keny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogeero, ayae kit ne leel; biitu anyun nguno; tos monae? Ayae oret eng’ ong’atet, ak ainosiek eng’ surkwen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konyita tiong’ikab timin, lelwek ak tiong’ikab songolik: amu agonu beek eng’ ong’atet, ak ainosiek eng’ surkwen, si anaga bikyuk, chechuk che kialewen: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bik che kiayachige, si kobiit kobarta kalosunennyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago ma iguura, ee Jakobo; ago kiing’et agobo ane, ee Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma igetwa areguk koek kagochinoiguk che kibeelei; ama igonyitena tiseiyweguk. Ma abirjin iotisie kagochinoik, ama aiimenen tuguk che nyamdut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma ialunena feda tuguk che u mutwek che nyamdut, ama igona abiyo eng’ mwanikab tiseiyweguk: ago kiimena tengekwogiguk, kiigona ang’et agobo yaitwogiguk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ane, ee anendet ne aistoi bistaosieguk, amu kainennyu; amabwati tengekwogiguk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibwatwa; ngeng’alal tuwai: tetu ng’aleguk, si kobiit kiityin imanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiyai tengekto kwandang’ung’ ne bo tai, ak kiingelelja kaletoiguk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amuruoni anyun bounik che bo ole tilil, ak ayae Jakobo koek ne chubot, ak ayae Israel koek ne kisasei.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
